---
import ComplianceNote from '../../../components/compliance/ComplianceNote.astro';
import Button from '../../../components/global/Button.astro';
import HeroSplit from '../../../components/sections/HeroSplit.astro';
import SectionIntro from '../../../components/sections/SectionIntro.astro';
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { contactLinks, socialLinks } from '../../../data/externalLinks';

const contactOptions = [
  {
    title: 'WhatsApp',
    copy: 'The simplest way is a brief message on WhatsApp.',
    href: contactLinks.whatsapp.href,
    label: 'Message Me on WhatsApp',
  },
  {
    title: 'Call Directly',
    copy: contactLinks.phone.label,
    href: contactLinks.phone.href,
    label: 'Call Me',
  },
  {
    title: 'Send an Email',
    copy: contactLinks.email.label,
    href: contactLinks.email.href,
    label: 'Send an Email',
  },
  {
    title: 'In-Person Consultation in the Lüneburg District',
    copy: 'If you live in the Lüneburg district or nearby, we can also arrange to meet in person.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Online Consultation',
    copy: 'If meeting in person is not possible, we can also have the consultation conveniently by video call.',
  },
];
---

<PageLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Contact Kyle for doTERRA Guidance | Kyle Oils"
  description="Ask your questions about essential oils, starter kits and routines by WhatsApp, phone, email or, by arrangement, video call."
>
  <HeroSplit
    title="Let’s Talk"
    primaryHref={contactLinks.whatsapp.href}
    primaryLabel="Message Me on WhatsApp"
    secondaryHref="#contact-options"
    secondaryLabel="View Contact Options"
    imageSrc="/assets/images/about/contact-kyle-horse.jpg"
    imageAlt="Kyle with a horse in nature"
    imageWidth={1132}
    imageHeight={1390}
    imagePosition="50% 52%"
    imageSources={[
      { type: 'image/avif', srcset: '/assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-640.avif 640w, /assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-960.avif 960w' },
      { type: 'image/webp', srcset: '/assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-640.webp 640w, /assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-960.webp 960w' },
    ]}
  >
    <p>You do not need to know which oil, starter kit or routine is right for you yet.</p>
    <p>Simply tell me what interests you or what you would like help with. You can reach me by WhatsApp, phone or email. In-person meetings by arrangement and video calls are also possible.</p>
  </HeroSplit>

  <section id="contact-options" class="section section--sage">
    <div class="container">
      <SectionIntro title="How to Reach Me">
          <p>WhatsApp, phone or email are all good first steps. I usually respond within 24 hours.</p>
      </SectionIntro>
      <div class="contact-grid">
        {contactOptions.slice(0, 3).map((option) => (
          <article class="contact-card">
            <h3>{option.title}</h3>
            {option.copy && <p>{option.copy}</p>}
            {option.href && option.label && <a href={option.href}>{option.label}</a>}
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="contact-formats">In-person meetings in the Lüneburg district and video calls are also possible by arrangement.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream local-guidance-section">
    <div class="container local-guidance-section__inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">GERMANY & ONLINE</p>
        <h2>Essential oil guidance in Germany</h2>
        <p>If you live in Germany, have questions about doTERRA or prefer to speak English, you can find a calm overview here.</p>
      </div>
      <Button href="/en/essential-oil-guidance-germany/" variant="secondary">Essential Oil Guidance Germany</Button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="social-section" aria-label="Social Media">
    <div class="container social-layout">
      <p class="social-section__label">Find Kyle Oils on social media</p>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href={socialLinks.facebook.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 8h3V4h-3c-3 0-5 2-5 5v2H6v4h3v7h4v-7h3l1-4h-4V9c0-.6.4-1 1-1Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Facebook</span>
        </a>
        <a href={socialLinks.linkedin.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6.5 8.5H3V21h3.5V8.5ZM4.8 3A2.1 2.1 0 1 0 5 7.2 2.1 2.1 0 0 0 4.8 3ZM21 14.1c0-3.8-2-5.9-4.8-5.9-2.2 0-3.2 1.2-3.8 2.1V8.5H9V21h3.5v-6.2c0-1.6.3-3.2 2.3-3.2s2 1.9 2 3.3V21H21v-6.9Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>LinkedIn</span>
        </a>
        <a href={socialLinks.instagram.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7.5 2h9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 22 7.5v9a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5h-9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 2 16.5v-9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.5 2Zm0 2A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 4 7.5v9A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 7.5 20h9a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 3.5-3.5v-9A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 16.5 4h-9ZM12 7a5 5 0 1 1 0 10 5 5 0 0 1 0-10Zm0 2a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6Zm5.25-3.5a1.25 1.25 0 1 1 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 0-2.5Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Instagram</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="compliance-section">
    <div class="container">
      <ComplianceNote label="Note">
        <h2>A Brief Note</h2>
        <p>My support is not a substitute for medical diagnosis or treatment.<br />I do not claim that products can diagnose, treat or cure medical conditions.</p>
        <p>My focus is on clear guidance, practical daily routines, product information and personal support. For health concerns or medical questions, please consult an appropriately qualified professional.</p>
      </ComplianceNote>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .section { padding: var(--space-64) 0; }
  .section--cream { background: var(--color-soft-cream); }
  .section--sage { background: rgb(168 184 160 / 20%); }
  .local-guidance-section__inner { display: grid; gap: var(--space-24); align-items: center; max-width: var(--container-text); }
  .local-guidance-section__inner h2 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-12); font-size: var(--font-size-h2-mobile); line-height: var(--line-height-heading); }
  .local-guidance-section__inner p:not(.eyebrow) { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .local-guidance-section__inner .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 var(--space-12); }
  .contact-grid { display: grid; gap: var(--space-20); }
  .contact-card { min-height: 230px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: var(--space-24); border: 1px solid rgb(216 199 173 / 65%); border-radius: var(--radius-card); background: var(--color-warm-white); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
  .contact-card h3 { margin: 0 0 var(--space-12); font-size: var(--font-size-h3-mobile); line-height: 1.2; }
  .contact-card p { margin: 0 0 var(--space-24); overflow-wrap: anywhere; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .contact-card a { min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-top: auto; padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-20); border: 1px solid var(--color-sand); border-radius: var(--radius-button); color: var(--color-deep-forest); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; }
  .contact-card a:hover { border-color: var(--color-sage-green); background: var(--color-soft-cream); }
  .contact-formats { max-width: var(--container-text); margin: var(--space-32) 0 0; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .social-section { padding: var(--space-24) 0 var(--space-48); }
  .social-layout { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-16) var(--space-24); align-items: center; }
  .social-section__label { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: var(--font-size-small); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); }
  .social-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-16); }
  .social-links a { min-height: 52px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-12); padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-20); border: 1px solid var(--color-sand); border-radius: var(--radius-button); color: var(--color-deep-forest); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); text-decoration: none; }
  .social-links a:hover { border-color: var(--color-sage-green); background: var(--color-warm-white); }
  .social-links svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: currentColor; }
  .compliance-section { padding: var(--space-24) 0 var(--space-64); }
  .compliance-section :global(.compliance-note) { max-width: 760px; padding: var(--space-24) 0 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgb(216 199 173 / 65%); border-radius: 0; background: transparent; }
  .compliance-section :global(h2) { margin: 0 0 var(--space-12); font-size: var(--font-size-body-mobile); }
  .compliance-section :global(p + p) { margin-top: var(--space-12); }
  #contact-options { scroll-margin-top: var(--space-32); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .section { padding-block: var(--space-96); }
    .social-section { padding: var(--space-32) 0 var(--space-64); }
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-24); }
    .local-guidance-section__inner { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: var(--space-40); }
    .contact-card { padding: var(--space-32); }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .section { padding-block: var(--space-120); }
    .social-section { padding: var(--space-40) 0 var(--space-80); }
    .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .local-guidance-section__inner h2 { font-size: var(--font-size-h2-desktop); }
  }
</style>
